{"unit_id":"Diluka__dsh-afk#card-zh","repo":"Diluka/dsh-afk","commit":"e8f96c86317597340b185bf884f20ef4ef27d37b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-afk 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的离开模式插件，可按会话或当前 profile 全局启用。它在 ask_user_question 调用时自动返回用户设置的文字，或在离开期间禁用提问，并为每个会话保存问题、回答和处理状态。用户可用 AFK 开关和设置页管理模式与回复，用记录窗口筛选未读或全部历史、标记已读，也可通过 /afk 命令或可选 Agent 工具查询记录。适合暂时离开电脑、希望 Agent 在既有授权范围内继续处理并在回来后查看提问的人；无需额外 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:46","index.js:140","client.js:766","history.js:48"]}
{"unit_id":"Diluka__dsh-afk#card-en","repo":"Diluka/dsh-afk","commit":"e8f96c86317597340b185bf884f20ef4ef27d37b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-afk adds away mode to DSH web: it sends custom replies or disables questions, and keeps session history. Configure per-session or profile-wide behavior, review records, and mark them read in the settings UI. Optional Agent tools can query history. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:46","index.js:140","client.js:766","history.js:48"]}
