{"unit_id":"Diluka__dsh-afk#feature-reply","repo":"Diluka/dsh-afk","commit":"e8f96c86317597340b185bf884f20ef4ef27d37b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-afk 的自动回复功能：开启后，普通 ask_user_question 会收到配置的自定义文本，并保留问题 ID；回复带有 AFK 标识，不会代替用户选择选项。可在会话或全局模式启用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:140-158"]}
{"unit_id":"Diluka__dsh-afk#feature-history","repo":"Diluka/dsh-afk","commit":"e8f96c86317597340b185bf884f20ef4ef27d37b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-afk 的提问历史功能：记录会话中的问题、答案和处理状态，并提供未读或全部记录的分页查询；用户可通过界面或 /afk history 查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:46-62"]}
{"unit_id":"Diluka__dsh-afk#feature-settings","repo":"Diluka/dsh-afk","commit":"e8f96c86317597340b185bf884f20ef4ef27d37b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-afk 的 AFK 设置功能：可切换会话独立或 profile 全局作用范围，设置自动回复或禁用提问模式，并编辑回复文字。Web 客户端在插件设置页和输入框旁提供控制。","source":"generated","evidence":["config.js:13-21"]}
{"unit_id":"Diluka__dsh-afk#feature-agent-tools","repo":"Diluka/dsh-afk","commit":"e8f96c86317597340b185bf884f20ef4ef27d37b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-afk 的历史工具功能：启用后 Agent 可调用 afk_history 分页查看当前会话记录，并调用 afk_mark_read 标记选中记录；此开关独立于 AFK 模式。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:81-130"]}
{"unit_id":"Diluka__dsh-afk#caveat-1","repo":"Diluka/dsh-afk","commit":"e8f96c86317597340b185bf884f20ef4ef27d37b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-afk 的自动应答只处理普通提问，禁用提问也不会替用户批准权限或计划；自动回复不是人的确认。模式只影响新派发的问题，不接管已经等待中的问题。见 index.js:18-19、index.js:140-143。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:18-19","index.js:140-143"]}
